Rips_SetReferralTiers
├── when the caller is not the owner
│   └── it should revert.
└── when the caller is the owner
    ├── when tiers count exceeds max referral tier count
    │   └── it should revert.
    ├── when tiers are not sorted by minVolume ascending
    │   └── it should revert.
    ├── when tiers have duplicate minVolume values
    │   └── it should revert.
    ├── when tiers are valid
    │   ├── it should replace any previously stored tiers for that currency.
    │   └── it should emit a {ReferralTiersUpdated} event with the currency.
    └── when tiers are set for different currencies
        └── it should store tiers independently per currency.
